<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS PLACE NO BIDS AT REVERSE REPO.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS PLACE NO BIDS AT REVERSE REPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks did not place any bids at the central bank's 200 million zloty 14-day reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction on Wednesday, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
